"en": "Treasure"
}
description = "（内部）不从搜索、商店、敌人背负里随机出的珍品：护符、工艺摆件、果果之心……只从掉落与宝箱来。"
descriptions = {
"en": "(Internal) A rare find that never comes from searches, shops or what enemies carry: charms, ornaments, the Heart of Guoguo. Only from drops and chests."
}
